          <p>Childwall's combi boilers were mostly fitted in the 1990s, 2000s and 2010s. They wear out at 12 to 15 years. Heat exchangers scale up. Diverter valves stick. We fix what we can. We replace what we can't.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Burst Pipes in Cold Snaps</h3>
