          <p>The 1930s lofts in Childwall aren't always well insulated. Cold weeks each winter cause pipe bursts above ceilings. We attend 24/7. We can lag the pipes on the same visit so it doesn't happen again next year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Unvented Cylinder Faults</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
