        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">4</span><div><strong>Photograph the damage</strong><p>Take photos and video before you start cleaning. Insurance claims need proof. We write our own fault report with photos as well, ready for your insurer.</p></div></div>
